&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Small kitbash of the nyx parts with a new torso to make some prototype proof of concept pilots for the hecate and thanatos. Only monopose because of this
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;The 2 seated models will need to be digitally kitbashed into the mech torsos of your choice, included at both 32mm and 28mm scale. The mechs will need to be scaled to 115% for the 32mm scale pilots but is the recommended scale to do them at
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;2 on foot pilots
