&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;5 helmets compatible with the nyx helmets as well
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Getting to the point of making custom pilots with mechs was one of my main objectives when I started 3d modelling nearly 2 years ago now, so just thought I&amp;#39;d share these now I&amp;#39;ve finally met that goal :)
